# DC Motor - Speed / Voltage
# First Order System
#
# Model: J*dw/dt + f*w = Km*u
# H(p) = (Km/f) / (1 + (J/f)*p)
#
# Km = 0.5 N.m/A, f = 0.1 N.m.s/rad, J = 0.02 kg.m^2
# K = Km/f = 5.0 rad/s/V, tau = J/f = 0.2 s
#
# Numerator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
: 5.0
# Denominator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
:: 1 0.2
